          <p class="no-bg experience-detail-section">
            <span class="experience-section-kicker">02 · Case study</span>
            <span class="experience-section-title">DRIME Video Editor</span></br></br>
            What it is</br></br>
            A standalone editor (distinct from the player) to create slideshows from short videos/photos with customizable transitions. Like the player, it’s multilingual, responsive, interactive, embeddable, and lightweight.</br></br>
            Speed of production</br></br>
            With pre-selected media and text, clients can create & publish a video in ~5 minutes. Adding another language (voiceover, subtitles, etc.) takes ~2 minutes. Logos and soundtracks can be added. In short, with minimal prep, a multilingual video can be produced in ~10 minutes and published immediately. Export via iframe, a single embed code line, or as a showcase on the DRIME platform<br>
